吉他｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>貝斯｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>混音｜陳柏豪</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-media\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-gallery\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-gallery-25\"><h2 id=\"work-media-gallery-25\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Gallery</h2><div class=\"work-media-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1U4tPBlWnSjGpzuA3stniMXVnz_TG-y-k.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"【神魔之塔】《同行》- 神魔之塔11週年主題曲 — 封面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1U4tPBlWnSjGpzuA3stniMXVnz_TG-y-k.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1U4tPBlWnSjGpzuA3stniMXVnz_TG-y-k-300x300.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1U4tPBlWnSjGpzuA3stniMXVnz_TG-y-k-150x150.webp 150w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1U4tPBlWnSjGpzuA3stniMXVnz_TG-y-k-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure></div></section><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-embed work-media-embed--youtube\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-youtube-25\"><h2 id=\"work-media-youtube-25\" class=\"work-media__heading\">YouTube</h2><div class=\"work-media-embed__frame work-media-embed__frame--youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/64iHB-gnZ1g\" title=\"【神魔之塔】《同行》- 神魔之塔11週年主題曲 — YouTube video\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></section><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-embed work-media-embed--spotify\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-spotify-25\"><h2 id=\"work-media-spotify-25\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Spotify</h2><div class=\"work-media-embed__frame work-media-embed__frame--spotify\"><iframe src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/0K11WDX3A9RS2Zh7eibv6W\" title=\"【神魔之塔】《同行》- 神魔之塔11週年主題曲 — Spotify player\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"autoplay;